WEBVTT

00:00:01.249 --> 00:00:02.951
No one realizes it,

00:00:02.951 --> 00:00:06.187
but Season Fairies
are right near humans.

00:00:06.187 --> 00:00:08.056
They're like neighbors.

00:00:08.056 --> 00:00:11.893
If you were my neighbor, Sugar,
it would be noisier than I could stand.

00:00:11.893 --> 00:00:16.064
What do you mean?
I'm not noisy! I'm being quiet!

00:00:16.064 --> 00:00:20.668
Oh, be quiet. Don't talk
in my ear, Sugar!
I'm ladylike!
I'm silent! I'm not talking!

00:00:20.668 --> 00:00:21.336
I'm ladylike!
I'm silent! I'm not talking!

00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:23.236
I'm not a chatterbox!
Saga, I like you...

00:00:23.338 --> 00:00:27.008
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:30.078
On my lips,

00:00:30.078 --> 00:00:34.412
The rouge of tears.

00:00:54.569 --> 00:00:58.039
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:58.039 --> 00:01:05.536
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:12.687
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:12.687 --> 00:01:15.557
On my lips,

00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:19.118
The rouge of tears.

00:01:23.464 --> 00:01:27.168
On Thursdays

00:01:27.168 --> 00:01:30.071
I buy roses and...

00:01:30.071 --> 00:01:34.303
add a letter.

00:01:37.845 --> 00:01:41.549
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:41.549 --> 00:01:44.419
When I see you
in my dreams,

00:01:44.419 --> 00:01:49.413
you're so caring.

00:02:09.644 --> 00:02:11.112
Look. Look, Saga.

00:02:11.112 --> 00:02:13.448
The magic flowers
are about to bloom.

00:02:13.448 --> 00:02:15.109
That's great, Sugar.

00:02:15.817 --> 00:02:20.021
I knew they'd
grow up today.

00:02:20.021 --> 00:02:21.010
Huh?

00:02:21.122 --> 00:02:23.992
I mean, I had so
much fun yesterday!

00:02:23.992 --> 00:02:27.262
You'll be a full-fledged
Season Fairy soon.

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:30.493
Yeah! I'll be a great Snow Fairy,
just like my mommy!

00:02:41.509 --> 00:02:44.078
Today we're going to
straighten up after the festival.

00:02:44.078 --> 00:02:46.347
Let's all clean
up the town.

00:02:46.347 --> 00:02:47.507
-Ok!
-Ok!

00:02:47.649 --> 00:02:53.087
Boys, your job is to carry the large props
and decorations back to the storage area.

00:02:53.087 --> 00:02:56.724
And girls, you clean up the
streets and pick up trash.

00:02:56.724 --> 00:02:58.092
Huh, you want to
thank me for what?
And girls, you clean up the
streets and pick up trash.

00:02:58.092 --> 00:02:58.726
Huh, you want to
thank me for what?

00:02:58.726 --> 00:03:02.363
You gave me cookies yesterday,
so I want to thank you.

00:03:02.363 --> 00:03:04.165
What would you like?

00:03:04.165 --> 00:03:06.100
That's not necessary.

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:09.103
No. I want to do something for you.
Come on, come on.

00:03:09.103 --> 00:03:10.238
It doesn't matter.
No. I want to do something for you.
Come on, come on.

00:03:10.238 --> 00:03:12.106
Of course it matters, Saga.

00:03:12.106 --> 00:03:18.112
After having fun at the
festival, we have to clean up.

00:03:18.112 --> 00:03:19.113
R-Right.

00:03:19.113 --> 00:03:20.307
All right.

00:03:20.615 --> 00:03:25.848
Everyone, please meet back here
again when the evening bell rings.

00:03:26.054 --> 00:03:27.419
-Ok!
-Ok!

00:03:27.655 --> 00:03:31.526
Saga, are you gonna
clean up? If so, I'll help!

00:03:31.526 --> 00:03:32.527
-Ok, ok.

00:03:32.527 --> 00:03:33.459
-Ok, ok.
-Waffo!

00:03:34.062 --> 00:03:35.063
Hey, Saga.

00:03:35.063 --> 00:03:37.398
Where should we
start cleaning?

00:03:37.398 --> 00:03:40.068
Somewhere that's not too dirty.

00:03:40.068 --> 00:03:41.126
Yeah.

00:03:41.502 --> 00:03:43.604
Let's go down this road.

00:03:43.604 --> 00:03:46.074
The castle wall will
be easy to clean.

00:03:46.074 --> 00:03:47.075
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:03:47.075 --> 00:03:49.077
Waffo! I'll help!

00:03:49.077 --> 00:03:50.345
Good thinking, Saga.

00:03:50.345 --> 00:03:53.981
You're great to have around, Saga.
You make the right decisions.

00:03:53.981 --> 00:03:56.074
Saga, hurry. Hurry!

00:03:57.018 --> 00:03:58.007
Ok, ok.

00:04:08.896 --> 00:04:10.098
What is it, Norma?

00:04:10.098 --> 00:04:12.100
That was a big sigh.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.194
It just seems so
lonely after a festival.

00:04:16.137 --> 00:04:17.126
You're right.

00:04:18.106 --> 00:04:19.095
-Here!
-Here!

00:04:20.108 --> 00:04:22.372
Thanks for always being
such good friends!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.646
Let's continue
being good friends.

00:04:25.646 --> 00:04:27.238
Please don't give up on me!

00:04:47.268 --> 00:04:50.505
It's too soon to get
all sad, Miss Saga.

00:04:50.505 --> 00:04:51.506
Greta!

00:04:51.506 --> 00:04:55.076
What? You're feeling a little
sentimental now that the festival's over.

00:04:55.076 --> 00:04:59.843
But you don't need to. Soon there
will be something even more wonderful.

00:05:00.114 --> 00:05:01.809
Something more wonderful?

00:05:02.583 --> 00:05:04.346
Want me to tell you?

00:05:04.585 --> 00:05:05.574
Saga.

00:05:06.087 --> 00:05:09.390
Help, Saga!
I'm stuck.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.391
I don't know.
Should I tell you?
Help, Saga!
I'm stuck.

00:05:10.391 --> 00:05:14.729
I don't know.
Should I tell you?

00:05:14.729 --> 00:05:19.098
Oh, my. Look at all this. I'm gonna go
straighten up. Greta, you stay here and clean.

00:05:20.168 --> 00:05:21.669
Oh, hey, Saga.

00:05:21.669 --> 00:05:22.937
-Wait, Saga.

00:05:22.937 --> 00:05:24.461
-Wait, Saga.
-I said, wait!

00:05:33.381 --> 00:05:36.578
It looks like everyone
is busy cleaning up today.

00:05:38.853 --> 00:05:41.055
Whew. Good grief.

00:05:41.055 --> 00:05:48.052
Oh, Mr. Wind, Mr. Wind,
please blow the trash together.

00:05:53.067 --> 00:05:54.591
Oh, my!

00:06:04.445 --> 00:06:06.714
It must be fun
being a Cloud Fairy.

00:06:06.714 --> 00:06:07.415
Huh?

00:06:07.415 --> 00:06:09.083
Clouds are so free.

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:10.551
What are you saying?

00:06:10.551 --> 00:06:13.087
You're going to become
a Sun Fairy, aren't you?

00:06:13.087 --> 00:06:18.320
Yeah, but still...
It must be cool.

00:06:26.834 --> 00:06:28.131
And then...

00:06:30.505 --> 00:06:32.039
-Who's that?

00:06:32.039 --> 00:06:33.174
-Who's that?
-I don't know.

00:06:33.174 --> 00:06:34.402
Saga!

00:06:34.575 --> 00:06:35.803
Hey!

00:06:40.047 --> 00:06:41.315
Where are Alan and Jan?

00:06:41.315 --> 00:06:43.651
Huh? Oh, them?

00:06:43.651 --> 00:06:47.989
Hey, aren't those the
props from the festival?

00:06:47.989 --> 00:06:52.426
Well, I figured maybe I could
use them in an experiment.

00:06:52.426 --> 00:06:54.996
But I got permission first.

00:06:54.996 --> 00:07:00.434
I'm taking them to the lab now, but if
those guys were with me, well, you know...

00:07:00.701 --> 00:07:03.638
The teacher would
find you? I give up.

00:07:03.638 --> 00:07:07.208
But I'm safe now.
You guys help me.

00:07:07.208 --> 00:07:09.076
I wanna go! I wanna go!

00:07:09.076 --> 00:07:10.941
All right.
Shall we go?

00:07:12.713 --> 00:07:14.115
I wanna go! Yay! I wanna go! Yay!

00:07:14.115 --> 00:07:17.084
I wanna go! Yay! I wanna go! Yay!
W-Well, it's been a while since
we've been to the lab, right?

00:07:17.084 --> 00:07:19.320
I wanna go! Yay! I wanna go! Yay!
If you say so...

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.087
I wanna go! Yay! I wanna go! Yay!

00:07:20.087 --> 00:07:24.353
Y-Yeah. I guess asking
never hurts. Ok, let's go!

00:07:36.571 --> 00:07:41.838
Wow, thanks. Ok, now for classification.
You guys help, too!

00:07:43.044 --> 00:07:45.274
Who does he think he is?

00:07:45.746 --> 00:07:48.049
Ok, put this over there.

00:07:48.049 --> 00:07:49.150
And he's not even listening.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.151
And he's not even listening.
Sugar.

00:07:50.151 --> 00:07:51.140
What?

00:07:51.319 --> 00:07:52.877
Look at this!

00:07:56.023 --> 00:07:57.047
Don't you remember?

00:08:08.069 --> 00:08:11.061
Silly Sugar, getting
trapped in here...

00:08:11.939 --> 00:08:14.999
Well, I thought the
bell was a "Twinkle".

00:08:17.411 --> 00:08:22.474
Yeah. All you did was search for
the "Twinkle" back then, huh, Sugar?

00:08:23.084 --> 00:08:25.018
Oh, Saga, look!

00:08:27.722 --> 00:08:30.020
I rode this and
saved the Mr. Turtle.

00:08:30.524 --> 00:08:32.515
Oh, yeah, I remember.

00:08:45.039 --> 00:08:50.306
Whee! Lancelot!
I flew! I flew!

00:09:02.056 --> 00:09:05.253
-Wow! Cool!
-Wow! Cool!

00:09:09.897 --> 00:09:11.626
It's so nostalgic...

00:09:11.699 --> 00:09:14.600
It's too soon to get
all serious, Miss Saga!

00:09:15.202 --> 00:09:17.505
Greta!
When did you get here?

00:09:17.505 --> 00:09:20.908
What? Are you feeling
nostalgic over some memories?

00:09:20.908 --> 00:09:23.433
There's something
much more fun than that!

00:09:23.778 --> 00:09:25.006
Something more fun?

00:09:25.446 --> 00:09:25.913
-Ex

00:09:25.913 --> 00:09:26.380
-Exact

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.348
-Exactly.

00:09:27.348 --> 00:09:28.716
-Exactly.
-Hey!

00:09:28.716 --> 00:09:30.351
Phil, are you here?

00:09:30.351 --> 00:09:31.018
-Alan.

00:09:31.018 --> 00:09:32.019
-Alan.
-Jan.

00:09:32.019 --> 00:09:33.621
-You're in trouble, Phil.

00:09:33.621 --> 00:09:35.923
-You're in trouble, Phil.
-The teacher's looking for you.

00:09:35.923 --> 00:09:38.025
Really? Uh-oh.

00:09:38.025 --> 00:09:40.161
Saga. Let's go, too!

00:09:40.161 --> 00:09:41.321
Saga.

00:09:42.596 --> 00:09:43.585
Ok!

00:09:45.733 --> 00:09:47.360
W-Wait for me!

00:09:52.039 --> 00:09:55.600
Phil, it's not right that you
should go off on your own.

00:09:55.943 --> 00:09:57.044
I'm sorry.

00:09:57.044 --> 00:09:59.480
And Saga, you should know
better than to play with him.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.469
I'm sorry.

00:10:01.449 --> 00:10:05.052
As long as you understand.
What's so funny?

00:10:05.052 --> 00:10:06.053
-Huh? Nothing!
-Huh? Nothing!

00:10:06.053 --> 00:10:07.680
Are you really sorry?

00:10:12.727 --> 00:10:15.059
So, we're back to this again.

00:10:15.496 --> 00:10:17.431
Sorry, you two.

00:10:17.431 --> 00:10:18.933
-Don't worry about it.

00:10:18.933 --> 00:10:21.265
-Don't worry about it.
-Yeah, it's fine.

00:10:24.672 --> 00:10:26.273
Saga, look...

00:10:26.273 --> 00:10:27.262
Yeah.

00:10:40.955 --> 00:10:44.789
I'm so lonely.
Won't anyone be my friend?

00:10:45.025 --> 00:10:47.928
That's him! The bear
from yesterday!

00:10:47.928 --> 00:10:49.020
Shh! Be quiet.

00:10:51.465 --> 00:10:54.457
So, this is what it's
like before a play starts.

00:11:03.043 --> 00:11:05.379
You love playing piano.

00:11:05.379 --> 00:11:07.715
I love your piano
playing, too, Saga!

00:11:07.715 --> 00:11:09.114
Me, too.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:13.448
So it's all right, Saga!
Play the piano, ok?

00:11:23.063 --> 00:11:27.268
But with your coffee, I don't
think that will bother us, Saga.

00:11:27.268 --> 00:11:28.826
Uh, um...

00:11:31.305 --> 00:11:33.296
Thank you, Saga.

00:11:37.077 --> 00:11:39.511
I wonder what
Vincent's doing?

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.570
Hey, Saga.

00:11:41.816 --> 00:11:43.551
What are you doing?

00:11:43.551 --> 00:11:44.916
Oh, sorry.

00:11:59.433 --> 00:12:01.535
Hey, why is it so noisy?

00:12:01.535 --> 00:12:04.095
This is our house.

00:12:05.439 --> 00:12:06.701
Please take this!

00:12:07.474 --> 00:12:09.032
Hey, Sugar.

00:12:09.577 --> 00:12:11.111
Oh, Basil, Cinnamon!

00:12:11.111 --> 00:12:13.671
What? Have you
run away again?

00:12:14.615 --> 00:12:17.015
Dummy.
Saga's with her, isn't she?

00:12:21.856 --> 00:12:23.721
Did you remember?

00:12:26.227 --> 00:12:27.524
I remember.

00:12:40.074 --> 00:12:44.879
From now on, Sugar's
hanging out with us. Right, Sugar?

00:12:44.879 --> 00:12:46.437
Yeah. Yay!

00:12:46.614 --> 00:12:50.607
Pepper told me it
didn't suit me at all.

00:12:51.085 --> 00:12:53.349
Didn't you like it?

00:12:54.088 --> 00:12:56.613
No. Not at all.

00:12:56.924 --> 00:12:59.984
But then you
came to help me.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.925
-Take that!
-Arghh!

00:13:05.099 --> 00:13:07.090
Ow. Ow. Ow...

00:13:12.406 --> 00:13:13.771
Oh, Sugar!

00:13:17.544 --> 00:13:21.115
But that's a good
memory for me.

00:13:21.115 --> 00:13:23.083
Yeah, me, too.

00:13:27.054 --> 00:13:30.724
We fought
and then made up.

00:13:30.724 --> 00:13:35.058
And then I heard
your mommy's song.

00:13:40.067 --> 00:13:42.670
That's why it's such
a good memory.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.071
Your mommy's song was
very beautiful, Saga.

00:13:46.674 --> 00:13:50.077
Really for real.
It was a very, very pretty song.

00:13:50.077 --> 00:13:51.544
Oh, I know!

00:13:51.679 --> 00:13:54.081
Hey, Saga, I'll be back soon.

00:13:54.081 --> 00:13:55.082
Where are you going?

00:13:55.082 --> 00:13:59.314
Huh? Oh, um, I just remembered
something I have to do.

00:14:00.087 --> 00:14:01.088
Oh. Hey...

00:14:01.088 --> 00:14:03.590
Hey, Saga. Help!

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.092
Saga, hurry.

00:14:05.092 --> 00:14:06.093
Oh, no!

00:14:06.093 --> 00:14:10.097
It's no use.
It's too heavy. Phil!

00:14:10.097 --> 00:14:13.089
What? Alan, Jan,
over here. Hurry!

00:14:21.108 --> 00:14:23.633
Whew. It's just the table left?

00:14:23.978 --> 00:14:26.046
I'm glad I got
you to help.

00:14:26.046 --> 00:14:27.911
Oh, it's nothing.

00:14:28.048 --> 00:14:30.346
Mr. Luchino,
Mr. Henry.

00:14:31.051 --> 00:14:32.119
-Hello.
-Hello.

00:14:32.119 --> 00:14:33.143
Hey, Saga.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.723
Looks like you're
finished cleaning up.

00:14:35.723 --> 00:14:38.487
We just finished, too.
Oh, hey...

00:14:38.625 --> 00:14:40.616
Why don't we all
have a cup of coffee?

00:14:40.928 --> 00:14:43.055
But we, um...

00:14:43.697 --> 00:14:45.460
Yeah! We'll have one.

00:14:46.066 --> 00:14:48.068
Come on in, everyone.

00:14:48.068 --> 00:14:49.558
-Ok.
-Ok.

00:15:02.583 --> 00:15:04.175
Delicious.

00:15:07.488 --> 00:15:08.455
Greta?

00:15:08.856 --> 00:15:12.792
Oh, Miss Saga.
It's too soon to relax.

00:15:13.694 --> 00:15:15.329
Greta. What's that?

00:15:15.329 --> 00:15:17.422
A new hair accessory?

00:15:18.098 --> 00:15:21.090
Oh! Ouch!

00:15:22.836 --> 00:15:23.962
Father!

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.542
I have something
to tell you all.

00:15:28.542 --> 00:15:31.045
It's very, very
wonderful news.

00:15:31.045 --> 00:15:32.637
So, what is it?

00:15:33.047 --> 00:15:35.249
What do you mean by "news"?

00:15:35.249 --> 00:15:38.412
Listen. A magnificent
day will arrive soon.

00:15:38.786 --> 00:15:41.050
That's right. I'm talking
about my birthday!

00:15:42.056 --> 00:15:48.062
So I wanted to invite
you all to my house.

00:15:48.062 --> 00:15:50.553
For a special birthday party!

00:15:51.965 --> 00:15:53.762
That's what's
so magnificent?

00:15:55.069 --> 00:15:57.438
They're so surprised,
they're speechless.

00:15:57.438 --> 00:15:59.133
Congratulations, Greta!

00:15:59.706 --> 00:16:03.143
I see. It's almost your
birthday. I didn't know.

00:16:03.143 --> 00:16:05.976
Hey, what present
would you like?

00:16:06.847 --> 00:16:08.644
What is it, Miss Saga?

00:16:09.316 --> 00:16:11.185
-Miss Saga, you...

00:16:11.185 --> 00:16:13.085
-Miss Saga, you...
-You sure have changed.

00:16:14.354 --> 00:16:16.090
Changed? How?

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:19.993
I don't know, but
you just seem different.

00:16:19.993 --> 00:16:23.097
Yeah, yeah.
You think so, too, Phil?

00:16:23.097 --> 00:16:25.032
You seem more
relaxed or something.

00:16:25.032 --> 00:16:27.468
You seem calmer
or something.

00:16:27.468 --> 00:16:30.562
But I like you this
way, too, Saga.

00:16:31.171 --> 00:16:35.437
I like the old, reliable Saga,
but I like how you are today, too.

00:16:36.143 --> 00:16:37.906
Huh? How I am today?

00:16:47.454 --> 00:16:48.785
All done!

00:16:49.423 --> 00:16:52.153
Man, I sure am tired.

00:16:56.063 --> 00:17:01.330
My spells won't give them
much of a breeze.

00:17:02.769 --> 00:17:06.762
But if this breeze reaches
everyone even just a little bit...

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.612
-What a nice breeze!

00:17:11.612 --> 00:17:12.738
-What a nice breeze!
-Yeah!

00:17:15.682 --> 00:17:17.417
Oh, what a nice breeze.

00:17:17.417 --> 00:17:19.408
On a day like this, I'm thankful.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:25.225
-Wow, cool!

00:17:25.225 --> 00:17:26.214
-Wow, cool!
-How pretty.

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:28.695
That turned out well.

00:17:28.695 --> 00:17:30.458
Huh? Yeah...

00:17:35.035 --> 00:17:40.040
What a waste. And after you
just got the clouds right. Why?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.042
It wasn't perfect...

00:17:42.042 --> 00:17:44.044
Hmph. I don't
understand you.

00:17:44.044 --> 00:17:46.013
No one understands.

00:17:46.013 --> 00:17:46.638
Huh?

00:17:47.047 --> 00:17:51.040
No one understands his heart...

00:17:56.056 --> 00:17:57.785
Hey, Ginger.

00:17:58.592 --> 00:18:02.585
Why are you always
with Turmeric?

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:06.333
Wh-Why're you
asking all of a sudden?

00:18:06.333 --> 00:18:10.370
Th-There's no deep
meaning behind it! Bye!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.361
Oh! Ginger.

00:18:25.886 --> 00:18:29.049
Good grief.
What a thing to ask.

00:18:32.826 --> 00:18:36.091
Everyone, thank you for
all your hard work today.

00:18:36.396 --> 00:18:41.026
Go home and rest tonight and come
back to school tomorrow full of energy.

00:18:41.535 --> 00:18:43.770
That's it for today.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.032
-Ok!
-Ok!

00:18:48.175 --> 00:18:51.838
I don't know.
You just seem different...

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.510
Yeah, yeah.
You think so, too, Phil?

00:18:57.417 --> 00:19:00.818
But... I like you
this way, too, Saga.

00:19:04.658 --> 00:19:07.456
Rain? Oh, no.
I didn't bring my umbrella.

00:19:21.074 --> 00:19:23.941
Have I really changed?

00:19:27.547 --> 00:19:29.538
I wonder why...

00:19:31.718 --> 00:19:32.878
Sugar.

00:20:03.817 --> 00:20:06.377
That was for the cookies!

00:20:07.621 --> 00:20:11.057
I didn't practice,
so I wasn't very good.

00:20:12.326 --> 00:20:15.591
That's not true at all.
Thank you, Sugar.

00:20:16.596 --> 00:20:17.585
Waffo!

00:20:19.833 --> 00:20:21.425
Oh, Sugar!

00:20:22.069 --> 00:20:24.333
Hey. You remember
this place, Sugar?

00:20:24.738 --> 00:20:25.727
What?

00:20:27.174 --> 00:20:30.803
This is where
I first met you.

00:20:33.714 --> 00:20:34.703
It is.

00:20:34.915 --> 00:20:37.679
I hope you'll stay
with me, Sugar.

00:20:40.887 --> 00:20:42.184
Saga!

00:20:42.356 --> 00:20:43.345
Grandma!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.827
So this is where you've been.
Here's your umbrella.

00:20:46.827 --> 00:20:48.124
Thanks, Grandma.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.032
Hey, Grandma.

00:20:52.032 --> 00:20:53.021
Yes?

00:20:54.534 --> 00:20:58.265
Can I come under your
umbrella with you?

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.029
Come on.

00:21:02.976 --> 00:21:04.307
Let's go.

00:21:13.453 --> 00:21:14.442
Waffo!

00:21:15.222 --> 00:21:16.553
Hey, Sugar.

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:17.891
What?

00:21:17.891 --> 00:21:21.292
Do you want to play
that song together tomorrow?

00:21:21.862 --> 00:21:23.296
My mother's song.

00:21:23.296 --> 00:21:26.066
Your mommy's song? Really?

00:21:26.066 --> 00:21:29.202
Waffo! I'll do it.
I'll do it. I'll play with you.

00:21:29.202 --> 00:21:30.871
I know it'll be fun.

00:21:30.871 --> 00:21:33.273
-Waffo! I can't wait! Waffo!

00:21:33.273 --> 00:21:34.831
-Waffo! I can't wait! Waffo!
-Sugar.

00:21:59.933 --> 00:22:03.733
Hey, Saga. Where's the piano?
Where'd it go?

00:22:04.137 --> 00:22:06.071
Wh-What?

00:22:21.121 --> 00:22:25.525
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:25.525 --> 00:22:29.062
Melting in the water...

00:22:29.062 --> 00:22:34.234
I found a street
lined with trees.

00:22:34.234 --> 00:22:39.105
Songs of stardust

00:22:39.105 --> 00:22:47.747
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows.

00:22:47.747 --> 00:22:52.986
You already knew...

00:22:52.986 --> 00:22:57.924
The happiness of
connecting our hearts...

00:22:57.924 --> 00:23:00.026
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.026 --> 00:23:07.934
When powdery snow
whirls in town,

00:23:07.934 --> 00:23:13.340
The season of flower
blossoms is near,

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:17.333
And I think of you.

00:23:19.613 --> 00:23:24.384
The love that melts
our hearts and

00:23:24.384 --> 00:23:34.055
The dreams are
in your heart...

00:23:39.866 --> 00:23:40.634
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:40.634 --> 00:23:45.906
Preview of Next Episode
Why, why, why? Why, why, why?
Where'd your piano go, Saga?

00:23:45.906 --> 00:23:48.074
Oh, don't make such a fuss.

00:23:48.074 --> 00:23:50.911
But your precious
piano has disappeared!

00:23:50.911 --> 00:23:53.778
We've gotta look
for it. Right, Saga?

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:56.071
What's wrong, Saga?

00:23:56.883 --> 00:24:01.081
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"The Vanished Promise."

00:24:01.354 --> 00:24:04.653
Mother... I really...
